    "summary": "This PR adds a full workspace-storage layer to Apilix: a browser/Electron storage driver, snapshot engine, four sync adapters (git, HTTP, S3, team server), an Electron IPC surface for encrypted credential storage, new server routes, and the WorkspaceManager/WorkspaceSwitcher UI, along with a large WORKSPACES.md design document and the fix that declares jsonwebtoken and bcryptjs in server/package.json. The only file diff supplied in this review context is WORKSPACES.md; the implementation files (client/src/utils/storageDriver.ts, syncEngine.ts, snapshotEngine.ts, server/index.js, electron/main.js, client/src/store.tsx, etc.) were omitted by the patch budget, so they could not be reviewed line by line here. Reviewers should focus on the omitted implementation files: credential handling/encryption in the Electron path, path/ID sanitisation for workspace and snapshot file names, error handling in the sync adapters, and authorization enforcement on the new server routes.",
